GPL isolation note:
This MIT-licensed main project deliberately keeps GPL components
(LilyPond, MuseScore) in two separate subprojects:
  - render-lilypond/  (GPL-2.0+, see render-lilypond/LICENSE)
  - render-musescore/ (GPL-2.0+, see render-musescore/LICENSE)

These communicate with the main project via HTTP API and MusicXML/MIDI
interchange format, so GPL does NOT "infect" the main codebase.
